    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Macro-Mines is a rogue-lite platformer where the world is reigned by rules of the iconic game 'Minesweeper'. In this sci-fi maze of shifting tiles and hidden dangers, you'll jump, dig, and uncover the secrets buried deep within a forgotten mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile holds a clue \u2014 is it a mine, a gem, or nothing\u2026? One wrong move could mean your end, but calculated risks can lead to rich rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575370/extras/d520e1878afd918e5adcf6783b43de02.avif?t=1751335463\" width=800 height=684 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It seems that some strange creatures are roaming this forgotten mine, dealing with them might just earn you a few extra gems \u2014 if you survive the encounter. But monsters and mines aren\u2019t the only dangers lurking here, so you better keep your eyes open wide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gems obtained to buy from the local store, to increase you odds of survival, or save them all to pay the fee to get to the upper levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you do not get to cross a level, do not worry, each run, depending on your performance, you will be able to upgrade your excavator, so in the next run you will be able to reach further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run counts. Even if you don't make it to the exit, depending on your performance, you will be able to upgrade your excavator with a skill tree, giving you better tools and abilities to push further on your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575370/extras/9d3c7097a6dc926ab83a9e6e1cfc37e2.avif?t=1751335463\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet roBob, a friendly ally that will help you to cross the mine, by guarding the shop, teaching you about the world and it\u2019s mechanics or just vibing along you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Macro-Mines is a rogue-lite platformer where the world is reigned by rules of the iconic game 'Minesweeper'. In this sci-fi maze of shifting tiles and hidden dangers, you'll jump, dig, and uncover the secrets buried deep within a forgotten mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile holds a clue \u2014 is it a mine, a gem, or nothing\u2026? One wrong move could mean your end, but calculated risks can lead to rich rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575370/extras/d520e1878afd918e5adcf6783b43de02.avif?t=1751335463\" width=800 height=684 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It seems that some strange creatures are roaming this forgotten mine, dealing with them might just earn you a few extra gems \u2014 if you survive the encounter. But monsters and mines aren\u2019t the only dangers lurking here, so you better keep your eyes open wide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gems obtained to buy from the local store, to increase you odds of survival, or save them all to pay the fee to get to the upper levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you do not get to cross a level, do not worry, each run, depending on your performance, you will be able to upgrade your excavator, so in the next run you will be able to reach further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run counts. Even if you don't make it to the exit, depending on your performance, you will be able to upgrade your excavator with a skill tree, giving you better tools and abilities to push further on your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575370/extras/9d3c7097a6dc926ab83a9e6e1cfc37e2.avif?t=1751335463\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet roBob, a friendly ally that will help you to cross the mine, by guarding the shop, teaching you about the world and it\u2019s mechanics or just vibing along you.</p>",
